  "label": "Abusive Meme Tone",
  "description": "The meme's overall tone is abusive, as it uses a vulnerable image (the baby) to deliver a violent threat. This requires understanding that memes can be used to convey harmful, intimidating, or abusive messages, even if they are presented in a seemingly innocent or humorous way. The juxtaposition of innocence and violence is a common trope in abusive memes, designed to shock or intimidate.",
